    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Two worlds! Two fates! One man who can change it all!\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/98c5867a62990807c12d3deef76cabcf.avif?t=1753926371\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>1000+ beautiful 3D-rendered CG content</strong> depicting the story rendered in sharp, <strong>crisp 4K resolution</strong> for the <strong>highest quality</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Stunning animations including variants</strong>, showing fights, action, and drama with fluid, smooth movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 A sprawling, world-spanning story with engaging themes of trauma and past mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Three main routes</strong>, each with their own unique characters, story beats, and endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Many branching pathways and alternate endings</strong> along the story paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Immersive, original music tracks</strong> masterfully composed to enhance your gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/70c493890dd8d29fed28229fa9a5c991.avif?t=1753926371\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyrus is in a transitional point of his life, mired in past mistakes, fractured relationships and unresolved trauma. While attempting to restart his life in a new city with a new job, he is thrust into the fantasy world of Cadagan, tasked with taking down the evil insurgent king Monn Molian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/a0acfde455b8cad9b99b180d04100061.avif?t=1753926371\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The catch? Due to a mishap in the spell bringing him to Cadagan, Cyrus is now tethered to both worlds, forcing him to alternate days between each and overcome his seemingly-insurmountable and conflicting priorities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/9083078b9390c9663db086fea046234f.avif?t=1753926371\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, that isn't the last spanner in the works, with a girl from a long-gone, highly turbulent relationship suddenly reappearing in his life. With a rare second chance to restart and rebuild, Cyrus will take charge, address his past mistakes and seize his bright new future. Or, at least, he hopes!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Two worlds! Two fates! One man who can change it all!\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/98c5867a62990807c12d3deef76cabcf.avif?t=1753926371\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>1000+ beautiful 3D-rendered CG content</strong> depicting the story rendered in sharp, <strong>crisp 4K resolution</strong> for the <strong>highest quality</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Stunning animations including variants</strong>, showing fights, action, and drama with fluid, smooth movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 A sprawling, world-spanning story with engaging themes of trauma and past mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Three main routes</strong>, each with their own unique characters, story beats, and endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Many branching pathways and alternate endings</strong> along the story paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Immersive, original music tracks</strong> masterfully composed to enhance your gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/70c493890dd8d29fed28229fa9a5c991.avif?t=1753926371\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyrus is in a transitional point of his life, mired in past mistakes, fractured relationships and unresolved trauma. While attempting to restart his life in a new city with a new job, he is thrust into the fantasy world of Cadagan, tasked with taking down the evil insurgent king Monn Molian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/a0acfde455b8cad9b99b180d04100061.avif?t=1753926371\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The catch? Due to a mishap in the spell bringing him to Cadagan, Cyrus is now tethered to both worlds, forcing him to alternate days between each and overcome his seemingly-insurmountable and conflicting priorities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/9083078b9390c9663db086fea046234f.avif?t=1753926371\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, that isn't the last spanner in the works, with a girl from a long-gone, highly turbulent relationship suddenly reappearing in his life. With a rare second chance to restart and rebuild, Cyrus will take charge, address his past mistakes and seize his bright new future. Or, at least, he hopes!</p>",
    "short_description": "See dazzling 4K images and unravel an epic story in the visual novel Past Mistakes! Experience the story of Cyrus, a regular guy with a lot to answer for in his past, as he gets a rare second chance to heal and repair his past mistakes!",
